    "de": [
      "Wir bieten eine regionale und kreative Küche: Fondues, Barschfilets, Tartiflette, Froschschenkel... Veranstaltung von Festen und Banketten."
    ],
    "en": [
      "Offers a regional and creative cuisine including: fondues, perch fillets, tartiflette, frog legs... Dinners or parties can also be organised."
    ],
    "it": [
